{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S09把“想在难受时有人陪着”推进成“怕孤单到连那些气也肯再受”，比Y更替人物下判断，削弱了一点原本的心理暧昧。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用【】突出每段叙事的关键判断，感受文字又按音乐节点出现，观众比较容易在听音乐时迅速抓住人物此刻的处境和心理转折。它从离开后的失落、对亲近的怀念、反复动摇，到最终不再为了陪伴牺牲自己，前后推进比较清楚；感受也更具体地对应音型、节奏、力度和身体反应，不只是罗列情绪。Y的文字本身也有细腻之处，但右侧短词容易形成情绪清单，叙事重点与音乐变化之间的对应不如X鲜明。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6e3304cb-192e-4ced-8ca8-d13aa7c5a6b4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T023110739361Z", "elapsed_seconds": 62.985, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T02:32:13.745145+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "33d247ae822ad2f2b1e479386a5ee2d212c3ddfd743e0a4606d43ac24681cf93", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt